<biblStruct xml:id="b2">
	<monogr>
		<title level="m" type="main">During pre-training, the loss function parameters are set to 𝑣 = 0.95, 𝜃 1 = 0.05, 𝜃 2 = 0.03 and 𝛾 = 0.67, with the preset correction term 𝜖 set to 2. In the patient representation module, both GRU 𝑑 and GRU 𝑝 are configured with 64 hidden units. In the graph augmented patient similarity network module, the GATs have a dropout rate of 0.2. During the formal training phase, we set 𝑣 = 0.95, 𝜃 1 = 0.05, 𝜃 2 = 0.01 and 𝛾 = 0.50, with the preset correction term 𝜖 set to 2.04. The pre-training and formal training last for 15</title>
		<imprint/>
	</monogr>
	<note>Implementation Details. Throughout the training phase, we set the embedding dimension 𝑙 to 64 and the threshold 𝛿 to 0.5 and 25 epochs, respectively, and the Adam optimizer is employed with a learning rate of 𝑙𝑟 = 0.0005</note>
</biblStruct>

